---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Dashboard from '../components/Dashboard.astro';import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';import {generalFaq,features} from '../data/content';
---
<Layout title="Manage Smarter. Earn Beyond Vending." description="Explore VendBI vending management software, business intelligence and potential advertising connectivity through Vendvision Brand Network.">
<section class="home-hero"><div class="container"><div class="hero-top"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> THE NEXT PERSPECTIVE IN VENDING</p><h1>Manage Smarter.<br/>Earn <span class="serif-accent">Beyond</span><br/>Vending<span class="text-teal">.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Intelligent vending management meets advertising network connectivity.</p><p class="hero-subcopy">A clearer view of your operations. More informed decisions.<br class="desktop-break"/> And new possibilities for your eligible screens.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="btn" href="/book-demo/">Book a Demo <Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/vbn-advertising-network/">Explore VBN <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span>Built around operators.</span><span>Focused on possibility.</span></div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-label="Illustration of connected vending operations"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><span class="art-tag tag-one"><Icon name="chart"/> Operational intelligence</span><div class="vending-machine"><div class="machine-header"><span>vendBi<span class="text-teal">.</span></span><i></i></div><div class="machine-body"><div class="machine-window">{[0,1,2].map(row=><div class="product-row">{[0,1,2].map(col=><div class:list={['product',`product-${(row+col)%3}`]}><span></span></div>)}</div>)}</div><div class="machine-panel"><div class="machine-screen"><span>MORE THAN<br/>A MACHINE.</span><i>NEW POSSIBILITIES ↗</i></div><div class="machine-pay"></div><div class="machine-buttons"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></div><div class="machine-drawer"></div><div class="machine-base"><span>CONNECTED POSSIBILITIES</span><i></i></div></div><span class="art-tag tag-two"><span class="live-dot"></span> One connected perspective</span><div class="art-caption">CONCEPT ILLUSTRATION / NOT PRODUCT HARDWARE</div><span class="art-coordinate">OPERATIONS × INTELLIGENCE</span></div></div><div class="pillar-strip">{[['01','Manage','Your operations, in perspective.'],['02','Optimise','Your data, put to better use.'],['03','Monetise','Your screens, new possibilities.']].map(([n,title,desc])=><a href={n==='03'?'/vbn-advertising-network/':'/platform/'}><span class="pillar-number">{n}</span><div><h2>{title}</h2><p>{desc}</p></div><span class="pillar-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CLARITY CHANGES EVERYTHING</p><h2>Less guesswork.<br/>More perspective.</h2></div><div><p>See your vending business beyond individual machines. Explore a connected approach to operations, inventory and business intelligence.</p><a class="text-link" href="/platform/">Discover the platform <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div><Dashboard/></div></section>
<section class="section soft-bg"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE BUSINESS BEHIND THE MACHINES</p><h2>Everyday operations.<br/>Better-informed decisions.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/features/">Explore all features ↗</a></div><div class="feature-grid">{features.slice(0,3).map(f=><a class="feature-card" href="/features/"><span class="icon-box"><Icon name={f.icon}/></span><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>{f.text}</p><span class="card-link">Explore capabilities <span>↗</span></span></a>)}</div><p class="small-note">Workflows and feature availability depend on your hardware and package. Confirm details in a product demo.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container vbn-spotlight"><div class="vbn-visual"><div class="network-label"><span class="live-dot"></span> VENDVISION BRAND NETWORK</div><div class="media-screen"><span>YOUR SCREEN.<br/><em>A NEW<br/>PERSPECTIVE.</em></span><div>VBN <span>SCREEN NETWORK CONCEPT</span></div></div><div class="screen-stand"></div><span class="visual-caption">Illustrative media placement</span></div><div class="vbn-copy"><p class="eyebrow">BEYOND THE TRANSACTION</p><h2>Your screens could<br/>open new doors.</h2><p>Vending screens can be more than a point of purchase. Eligible operators can explore potential advertising participation through Vendvision Brand Network.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Explore screen and location eligibility</li><li>Discuss network readiness and onboarding</li><li>Understand campaign and commercial terms</li></ul><a class="btn" href="/vbn-advertising-network/">Meet the VBN opportunity ↗</a><p class="small-note">VBN is a distinct network. Participation and advertising revenue are not guaranteed. Integration availability requires confirmation.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section navy-bg"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR BUSINESS. YOUR NEXT STEP.</p><h2>Built around the way you grow.</h2><div class="audience-grid">{[['01','Independent operators','Make sense of everyday operations and build your next move.','/solutions/operators/'],['02','Growing fleets','Explore a broader perspective across machines and locations.','/solutions/operators/'],['03','Enterprise teams','Discuss deployment, oversight and integration requirements.','/solutions/enterprise/'],['04','Screen network partners','Explore eligibility and potential media participation.','/vbn-advertising-network/']].map(([n,t,d,h])=><a href={h}><span>{n} /</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">GOOD QUESTIONS. CLEAR ANSWERS.</p><h2>Before we<br/>get started.</h2><a class="text-link" href="/resources/faq/">Visit the FAQ ↗</a></div><FAQ items={generalFaq.slice(0,4)}/></div></section><CTA/>
</Layout>
